    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Hommage à Claude Vivier "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "As part of the Semaine du Neuf organized by Le Vivier, the Nouvel Ensemble Moderne (NEM), under the direction of Lorraine Vaillancourt, pays tribute to Quebec composer Claude Vivier. On this occasion, the NEM and Belgian soprano Myriam Leblanc will perform some of the most beautiful works from the prematurely deceased composer’s repertoire, as well as a piece by Serbian composer Marko Nikodijevic.6:00 PM - Round TableSOUVENIRS: Something Happened at the Événements du Neuf.with John Rea, Lorraine Vaillancourt, and Denis Gougeon - Moderated by Jeffrey Stonehouse.We wish to inform you that, due to exceptional circumstances, Katrien Baerts will not be able to join the NEM for the concert. We are pleased to welcome soprano Myriam Leblanc for the performance of Trois airs pour un opéra imaginaire and Bouchara."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/startDate": [
      {
        "@type": "http://schema.org/Date",
        "@value": "2023-03-08T00:30:00-05:00"
      }
    ]
  },
