        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "<p><strong>Finalistes:</strong><br><span>Francis Battah, Tom Lachance, Christina Volpini</span></p><p><span><strong>Jury :</strong></span><br><span>Lorraine Vaillancourt et &nbsp;Jean-Michaël Lavoie</span></p>"
